Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 08:12:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] fix(QF-20260904-724): widen resolveHoldProvenance to 4
 missing hold-reason keys

resolveHoldProvenance omitted human_action_note, human_action_reason,
human_action_required, and needs_coordinator_review_reason from its
precedence chain, causing 5 of 10 documented holds to render as "no
reason recorded (bare flag)" despite being fully documented. Adds the
four keys in their semantically-grouped slots (human-action siblings
after requires_human_action_reason, review sibling after
review_hold_reason), synthesizes a reason string for the boolean-only
human_action_required flag, and exports HOLD_REASON_KEYS so a
drift-detection test can diff live metadata keys against the resolver's
own list instead of re-deriving it by hand.

SD-LEO-INFRA-COORDINATOR-RECEIPTS-BROADCAST-CONSTRAINTS-001 FR-3.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DnuYdhjwMKyacLQBXn3J1S

Fleet-Worker: Alpha-3
