Subject: [PATCH 02/10] 
 feat(SD-LEO-INFRA-COORDINATOR-RECEIPTS-BROADCAST-CONSTRAINTS-001): widen
 signal receipts to all worker signals

FR-1: writeSignalReceipts (QF-20260906-162) was gated to
signal_type=stuck AND severity=high only. Removes that filter so
every worker signal in the coordinator inbox's enumerated batch gets
one correlation_id-idempotent receipt, renders a queued/routed/
needs-decision disposition line into the outbound row's Subject (the
inbox render has no generic payload-field render), and sizes the
existence-check bound to the batch's own length instead of a fixed
literal that a widened batch could exceed.

Registers capped_pool_broadcast (FR-2's kind, added alongside since
it shares the same PAYLOAD_KINDS/INFORMATIONAL_KINDS/
BACKPRESSURE_EXEMPT_KINDS registration pattern as signal_receipt) in
both copies of BACKPRESSURE_EXEMPT_KINDS, plus its role_drain_sets
migration.

