 fix(SD-LEO-INFRA-COORDINATOR-RECEIPTS-BROADCAST-CONSTRAINTS-001): sanitize
 all CONSTRAINTS block fields

SECURITY (sec-receipts-exec, evidence 3483a986): stampConstraintsBlock
rendered ratifications_cited, the four solomon_* fields, and
forbidden_framing(s) with no control-char stripping, while
resolveHoldProvenance/formatHoldProvenance's existing sanitizer
protected only the Hold line. A crafted metadata value could embed a
literal newline plus a forged "- Hold: ..." bullet indistinguishable
from a genuine sanitized hold line, or ANSI escape sequences (color
codes, erase-line, BEL) that would survive into the dispatched body.

Applies the same [\x00-\x1f\x7f]-stripping sanitizer used by
resolveHoldProvenance to every field this stamper renders directly,
so an injected newline collapses to a space instead of creating a new
line, and control/escape sequences never reach the rendered body.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XjY63pandj5ZCUyK795C4H

Fleet-Worker: Alpha-3
Claude-Session: a13f0a2c-1450-4259-9c75-de5009ca906a
